## Local secrets / environment
## RBAC Amendment v3 / Chunk 1 task 2: appsettings.Development.json is deliberately NOT
## ignored (see git history for the previous, broader rule) — it now carries a fixed,
## clearly-labeled, non-secret Development-only JWT signing key, committed on purpose so a
## fresh clone runs with zero extra setup (see /SETUP_AND_DEMO_GUIDE.md). Any environment
## other than Development still has to supply its own real key via user-secrets or the
## JWT__SigningKey environment variable — Program.cs refuses to start without one.
appsettings.*.local.json
*.env
.env
secrets.json

